{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://img.tvb.com/inews_admin/pro/20260524/entry_horizontal_6a1313b25023e5291fe6dc26_1779636858238_640x360.jpg\"/><p>神舟二十三號載人飛船，於酒泉衛星發射中心發射升空，飛船進入預定軌道，發射任務圓滿成功。首名香港太空人黎家盈隨飛船升空，太空夢圓。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-24T15:58:42.645279+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":64,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}